  "name": "Barbed Stinger grows while embedded, refunds its recovery on the throw and rips out on recast",
  "contract": "Barbed Stinger 803196 (20 sec recovery, requires Beetle Form 803183) clears Exposed Flesh 805095 and embeds 803206 for 10 sec plus 1 sec per cleared stack (tooltip; 805095 effect 1 = 1000 ms per stack). 803206 triggers 803207 'Add stack' every 1000 ms, adding one stack of 680854 (+50% rip-out damage taken from the caster per stack, at most 15 stacks; live combat logs show doses up to 15). Its slot 2 triggers 803220 'Reset Effect', -19000 ms on 803196, so the tooltip's recast on the same target (rip-out 803208, which removes the stinger and its stacks) is reachable during the stinger's lifetime. The rip-out itself keeps the authored 20 sec recovery: the refund is the throw's (Empowered Exoskeleton 705981 shortens that recovery by 5 sec, and the older 803284 text taunted on rip-out, neither of which fits a 1 sec rip-out cycle). Rip-out damage therefore scales with stacks: 15 stacks against 1-2 stacks is 8.5 / 1.5-2.0 = 4.25-5.67 times, above 2 even with worst-case damage rolls and a critical strike on the smaller hit only.",
